# 7. kiln refuses a spec that leaves the template.

# Given: an approved spec in .kiln/specs/ whose form leaves /shape's template.
# x lacks the template's Technical Plan. y holds every section, but its first test has no Then.
# When: the developer queues it.
! exec kiln queue x
! exec kiln queue y

# Then: kiln refuses it, and kiln status does not show it queued.
exec kiln status
stdout '^kiln holds no approved spec$'
! stdout '^[xy]:'

-- go.mod --
module example.com/scratch

go 1.27
-- .kiln/kiln.json --
{"acceptance": "acceptance/{spec}/", "gate": ["go vet ./...", "go test ./..."], "rounds": 1}
